"\nThis will include information related to a single Siri session that you have identified, used to help investigate and improve Siri.\n\nLogs for the identified session may include:\n- The on-device and Private Cloud Compute model versions used to process the session\n- Errors encountered while handling the session\n- Agent handoff events that occurred during the session\n- The final tool call made to fulfill the session's request\n\nYou can review the collected content in the attachments before submitting your feedback.\n"
